        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-26T02:16:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All,</p><p>I've not been really follow any news regarding&nbsp;<span>OblivAeon other than it's massively late. &nbsp;My interest level is high again since Gen Con is almost here. &nbsp;I recall pre-ordering&nbsp;</span><span>OblivAeon with foils and Ultimate Carrying Case, but I do not remember when it was available. &nbsp;The reason I want to know is that Kickstarter says I didn't back the project (this is weird and concerning), I don't seem to have a Backerkit account (from what I think I needed to have to get the foil heroes), and I cannot find any of my order receipts in email.</span></p><p>So I am trying to figure out when the entire thing started so I can check all of my bank statements to determine if I actually ordered anything. &nbsp;I have the foil heroes that was shipped...last Gen Con or Christmas maybe (I don't remember at all). &nbsp;If I didn't end up ordering it or it got cancelled somehow, that's fine, I'll just order when it's finally available. &nbsp;I just don't want to pay for something I should have paid for already.</p><p>Any assistance from fellow players or even Greater Than Great would be appreciative.</p><p>Thank you.</p>",
