        "raw": "<p>All,</p><p>I&#39;ve not been really follow any news regarding&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">OblivAeon other than it&#39;s massively late. &nbsp;My interest level is high again since Gen Con is almost here. &nbsp;I recall pre-ordering&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">OblivAeon with foils and Ultimate Carrying Case, but I do not remember when it was available. &nbsp;The reason I want to know is that Kickstarter says I didn&#39;t back the project (this is weird and concerning), I don&#39;t seem to have a Backerkit account (from what I think I needed to have to get the foil heroes), and I cannot find any of my order receipts in email.</span></p><p>So I am trying to figure out when the entire thing started so I can check all of my bank statements to determine if I actually ordered anything. &nbsp;I have the foil heroes that was shipped...last Gen Con or Christmas maybe (I don&#39;t remember at all). &nbsp;If I didn&#39;t end up ordering it or it got cancelled somehow, that&#39;s fine, I&#39;ll just order when it&#39;s finally available. &nbsp;I just don&#39;t want to pay for something I should have paid for already.</p><p>Any assistance from fellow players or even Greater Than Great would be appreciative.</p><p>Thank you.</p>",
