        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-26T15:48:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I tried logging in to BackerKit as a backer, not a creator. &nbsp;None of my accounts existed (I tried to do a password reset with my emails and my account didn't exist).</p><p>I did check my Pre-orders here, and it doesn't have any records of it. &nbsp;I'm pretty sure I did it through Kickstarter since I've been getting email updates from it over the years. &nbsp;This is why it seems weird Kickstarter doesn't display my account backing it. &nbsp;I clearly ordered something because I have the foil heroes.</p><p>I thought the date was around early 2016. &nbsp;I will check my statements again.</p><p>It's all very mysterious.</p><p>Thanks for the information.</p>",
